  Title:
    m_Untranslated: <b>Merge final-level GameObjects</b>
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '5. In the <b>Asset Transformer Toolbar</b>, select the <b>Merge</b>
      option.


      6. In the Merge panel, set <b>Type</b> to <b>Merge Final Level</b>.


      7.
      Make sure you have the top level <b>Moto prefab</b> selected in the <b>Hierarchy</b>,
      then select <b>Run</b> to apply the changes.

'
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items: []
